`a complete agency contract` MEANS `The contract of an agent` WITH
    `states the name and address of the agent` IS TRUE
    `states the name and head office address of the insurer, branch or mutual organisation` IS TRUE
    `states the rights and obligations of both sides` IS TRUE
    `states the content and scope of the agency` IS TRUE
    `states commission, bonus and support, if any` IS TRUE
    `states the term of the contract` IS TRUE
    `states the way of resolving disputes` IS TRUE
`an agency contract without a term` MEANS `The contract of an agent` WITH
    `states the name and address of the agent` IS TRUE
    `states the name and head office address of the insurer, branch or mutual organisation` IS TRUE
    `states the rights and obligations of both sides` IS TRUE
    `states the content and scope of the agency` IS TRUE
    `states commission, bonus and support, if any` IS TRUE
    `states the term of the contract` IS FALSE
    `states the way of resolving disputes` IS TRUE
#ASSERT `Dieu 126: the agency contract states the essential contents` `a complete agency contract`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 126: the agency contract states the essential contents` `an agency contract without a term`

§§ `Dieu 127: two principals, by vintage`

