`a life insurer and another life insurer` MEANS `Two engagements of an individual agent` WITH
    `first principal` IS `a life insurer`
    `second principal` IS `a life insurer`
    `types of insurance the first principal carries on` IS LIST `life insurance`
    `types of insurance the second principal carries on` IS LIST `life insurance`
`a life insurer that also sells health, and a health insurer` MEANS `Two engagements of an individual agent` WITH
    `first principal` IS `a life insurer`
    `second principal` IS `a health insurer`
    `types of insurance the first principal carries on` IS LIST `life insurance`, `health insurance`
    `types of insurance the second principal carries on` IS LIST `health insurance`
`a life insurer and a non-life insurer` MEANS `Two engagements of an individual agent` WITH
    `first principal` IS `a life insurer`
    `second principal` IS `a non-life insurer`
    `types of insurance the first principal carries on` IS LIST `life insurance`
    `types of insurance the second principal carries on` IS LIST `non-life insurance`
`a non-life insurer and a foreign non-life branch` MEANS `Two engagements of an individual agent` WITH
    `first principal` IS `a non-life insurer`
    `second principal` IS `a branch of a foreign non-life insurer`
    `types of insurance the first principal carries on` IS LIST `non-life insurance`
    `types of insurance the second principal carries on` IS LIST `non-life insurance`
`a mutual organisation and another` MEANS `Two engagements of an individual agent` WITH
    `first principal` IS `a microinsurance mutual organisation`
    `second principal` IS `a microinsurance mutual organisation`
    `types of insurance the first principal carries on` IS LIST `life insurance`
    `types of insurance the second principal carries on` IS LIST `life insurance`
`a mutual organisation and an insurer` MEANS `Two engagements of an individual agent` WITH
    `first principal` IS `a microinsurance mutual organisation`
    `second principal` IS `a life insurer`
    `types of insurance the first principal carries on` IS LIST `life insurance`
    `types of insurance the second principal carries on` IS LIST `life insurance`
