#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 127(1): the individual may not be the agent of both principals` `a life insurer and another life insurer`)
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 8 1) (`Dieu 127(1): the individual may not be the agent of both principals` `a life insurer and another life insurer`)
-- the readings part: a life insurer that also sells health, with a health insurer
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 127(1): the individual may not be the agent of both principals` `a life insurer that also sells health, and a health insurer`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 127(1): the individual may not be the agent of both principals` `a life insurer that also sells health, and a health insurer`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 8 1) (`Dieu 127(1): the individual may not be the agent of both principals` `a life insurer that also sells health, and a health insurer`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 127(1): the individual may not be the agent of both principals` `a life insurer and a non-life insurer`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 127(1): the individual may not be the agent of both principals` `a life insurer and a non-life insurer`)
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 127(1): the individual may not be the agent of both principals` `a non-life insurer and a foreign non-life branch`)
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 127(1): the individual may not be the agent of both principals` `a non-life insurer and a foreign non-life branch`)
